    "show_share": true,
    "description": "AKU-ISMC's Professor Jonas Otterbeck and Professor Mark LeVine (University of California, Irvine) have recently published two articles on music in Muslim contexts for the  Handbook of Contemporary Islam and Muslim Lives . The articles explore music in both historical and contemporary times, with greater emphasis on the 20th and 21st centuries.",
